    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "ECRA is the institute that researches '^0000FFEnergy Crystals^000000' that shall be used as an alternative energy source in the Rune-Midgarts Kingdom, which suffers from a shortage of energy.",
      "translation" : "盧恩-米德加茲王國能源短缺，因此我們ECRA致力於研究可作為替代能源的^0000FF能量結晶^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The reason for doing this?",
      "translation" : "為什麼要這樣做？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I would like to explain that we are not trying to make an excuse to get away from facing problem before I explain the reason. Never! So please let me finish.",
      "translation" : "在說明原因之前，我想先澄清，我們絕不是想找藉口逃避問題！請聽我把話說完。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Research Team has sent me the results they found.",
      "translation" : "研究團隊把他們的研究結果送來了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Energy Crystals turned out to be ^0000FFgenerated inside the bodies of some monsters^000000, and according to the research, stronger monsters generate higher-class energy crystals in their bodies.",
      "translation" : "研究發現，能量結晶會^0000FF在某些魔物體內生成^000000。根據研究，魔物越強，體內生成的能量結晶等級就越高。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Research Team decided to collect Energy Crystals by giving requests to adventurers, with appropriate rewards. That enables us to collect better and be more ^FF0000efficient^000000.",
      "translation" : "研究團隊決定委託冒險者收集能量結晶，並給予相應報酬。這樣既能提高收集效率，也能讓我們^FF0000更有效地^000000開展研究。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Energy Crystals, accumulated through hunting monsters by my request, shall be used for my research. ^0000FFSome of them are planned to be returned to adventurers.^000000",
      "translation" : "通過我釋出的委託狩獵魔物所收集的能量結晶，將用於研究。^0000FF其中一部分計劃返還給冒險者。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Adventurers can use collected Energy Crystals for ^FF0000upgrading equipments^000000 through me.",
      "translation" : "冒險者可以通過我使用收集到的能量結晶^FF0000升級裝備^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Reno]",
      "translation" : "[雷諾]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Reno",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If it works well, it seems to be good for both ECRA and adventurers.",
      "translation" : "如果進展順利，對ECRA和冒險者來說都會是雙贏。"
    },
